# ================================================================ SEEKER TO CONVERT (release check L2, 2026-10-07): an act source of [convert] in every color
# A seeker is someone searching without a settled faith. Two moments, a pair (calls UG, cycle s1 / calls WBR, cycle s2):
# the search finds a home, or a teacher who claims to be one. Holding [seeker]
# keeps it to people who were searching, so a convert is someone joining a faith they were not raised in.

== a faith that answers back
tier: everyday
at: faith body
